      "content": "I hear that, but honestly, the \"clean energy jobs\" thing feels like a bit of a stretch when you look at the actual layoffs in the manufacturing sector right now. The proponents' arguments seem pretty flimsy compared to the immediate, real-world costs my business is facing. Do you think their arguments actually hold up against the economic reality of local manufacturing, or are they just theoretical?",
